# raw RGBA stock image — autocrlf would silently corrupt it
*.rgba binary

# ws:registries-schema-hooks — append-only files every concurrent workstream PR appends a row/line to;
# union merge means two branches' appends both land instead of one clobbering the other.
size_log.csv merge=union
CHANGELOG.md merge=union

# ws:orchestrator fix (2026-09-07) — several tests use include_str!() to scrape source text and
# search for literal "\n"-delimited patterns (brace-matching, arm-boundary detection). Windows
# checkouts with core.autocrlf=true silently convert working-tree .rs files to CRLF, breaking every
# such LF-only literal search (found via new_subclip_undo_restores_pre_subclip_project failing after
# the media-library merge). Force LF regardless of the developer's global git config.
*.rs text eol=lf
